<view class="page"><text class="eyebrow">YOUR NEXT STEPS</text><view class="heading">每一步，都有着落。</view><view class="muted">点击节点更新自助办理进度。</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="notice pulse">正在读取任务…</view><view wx:if="{{!tasks.length && !loading}}" class="card empty"><view class="heading">从一件小事开始</view><view class="muted">AI 为你整理计划，你来决定下一步。</view><button class="gap" bindtap="ask">创建第一份办理计划</button></view><view wx:for="{{tasks}}" wx:for-item="task" wx:key="id" class="card"><view class="row"><text class="section-title">{{task.title}}</text><text class="badge">{{task.progress}}%</text></view><view class="progress"><view class="progress-fill" style="width:{{task.progress}}%"/></view><view wx:for="{{task.steps}}" wx:for-item="step" wx:key="title" class="step" bindtap="toggle" data-id="{{task.id}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-status="{{step.status}}"><text class="step-no {{step.status==='done'?'done':''}}">{{step.status==='done'?'✓':index+1}}</text><view class="step-body"><view>{{step.title}}</view><view class="muted small">{{step.description}}</view></view></view><button class="secondary gap" data-id="{{task.id}}" bindtap="remind">明天提醒我继续办理</button></view><view wx:if="{{reminders.length}}" class="card"><text class="section-title">站内提醒</text><view wx:for="{{reminders}}" wx:key="id" class="muted">{{item.displayAt}} · 继续办理任务</view><text class="notice">提醒在应用内查看，微信订阅通知尚未配置。</text></view><view class="notice">任务状态是你的自助办理记录，不代表学校已受理或审批。</view></view>